<title>USA: H&amp;R Block says names James Rose CIO.</title>
<headline>H&amp;R Block says names James Rose CIO.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>H&amp;R Block Inc said James Rose was chief information officer effective June 2.</p>
<p>Rose was previously chief information officer at Integon Corp's Integon Insurance Corp, Block said.</p>
<p>Rose replaces Judy Keisling, who becomes vice president, operation systems, Block said.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
